Placeholder so the directory is tracked. The actual sidecar
binary `maxbot_loopd-<target-triple>` is NOT checked in — see
the `bundle.externalBin` note in `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`
for the build command. Without a binary present,
`cargo tauri build` will fail with "external binary not found";
that's expected and intentional for dev checkouts.
